d, but I’m still unable to send MMS messages. What should I do next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":15,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:52:40.840245","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":15,"usage":{"completion_tokens":22,"prompt_tokens":2497}},{"content":"Thank you for checking. To help you further, I’ll need to guide you through a few quick checks on your phone to diagnose the issue. \n\nFirst, could you please check your phone’s status bar and let me know:\n- If you see any signal bars,\n- If you see any icons like “✈️ Airplane Mode,” “📶” (signal strength), “5G/4G/3G,” or “📱 Data Enabled,”\n\nThis will help determine if your phone has cellular service and mobile data, which are required for MMS. Please let me know what you see in your status bar.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":16,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:52:42.219218","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":16,"usage":{"completion_tokens":129,"prompt_tokens":7055}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":17,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:52:43.651487","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_Upe8mkj45pUZUhzwICQuCCme","name":"check_status_bar","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":17,"usage":{"completion_tokens":12,"prompt_tokens":2652}},{"content":"Status Bar: 📶⁴ Excellent | 5G | 📱 Data Enabled | 🔋 80%","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":18,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:52:43.651792","tool_call_id":"call_Upe8mkj45pUZUhzwICQuCCme","tool_calls":[],"tool_error":false,"turn_index":18,"usage":null},{"content":"Looking at my status bar, I see excellent signal strength, 5G, and the data icon is enabled. There’s no airplane mode icon showing. What should I check next?","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":19,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:52:44.877609","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":19,"usage":{"completion_tokens":39,"prompt_tokens":2693}},{"content":"Great, that means your phone has strong cellular service and mobile data is enabled. Next, let’s check if your phone’s APN (Access Point Name) settings are correct, as incorrect APN settings can prevent MMS from working.\n\nCould you please check your APN settings and let me know if the MMSC (Multimedia Messaging Service Center) URL is set? If you’re not sure how to check, let me know and I can guide you through the process.","native_cost":0.0,"participant":"evaluated_agent","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"assistant","sequence":20,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:52:46.354026","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":20,"usage":{"completion_tokens":97,"prompt_tokens":7227}},{"content":null,"native_cost":0.0,"participant":"user_simulator","reasoning":null,"requestor":null,"role":"user","sequence":21,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:52:47.648725","tool_call_id":null,"tool_calls":[{"arguments":{},"id":"call_pdjmnGN5GWRVAVK7yG1fhNkJ","name":"check_apn_settings","requestor":"user_simulator"}],"tool_error":null,"turn_index":21,"usage":{"completion_tokens":13,"prompt_tokens":2833}},{"content":"Current APN Name: internet\nMMSC URL (for picture messages): http://mms.carrier.com/mms/wapenc\n(These are technical settings, usually best left unchanged.)","native_cost":null,"participant":"tool_environment","reasoning":null,"requestor":"user_simulator","role":"tool","sequence":22,"thinking_blocks":null,"timestamp":"2026-10-20T17:52:47.648954","tool_ca